    "authors.aiNote": "Written with the help of AI tools: Claude Opus 5.5 (Anthropic), through Claude Code, for code, text, references and translation, and Gemini in Google Search (AI Mode, Google; model version not disclosed by the service) for early exploration on 17 October 2026. The authors directed the work and take responsibility for it; see the paper's declarations. Every \"referee\", \"panel\" or \"review round\" mentioned in the paper was an AI review run by the first author with Claude; no human peer review has taken place.",
